      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen for Nails: What One Small Study Can and Cannot Tell You</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Almost every page selling collagen for nails cites the same study, and almost none of them say how small it was. Here is what it actually found, what it could not show, and the causes of brittle nails that a supplement will never fix.</p>

      <div class="jr-byline">
